### listing all assigned projects

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/

### create an assigned project

POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "project":2,
    "coordinator":2,
    "developers":[5,9,11],
    "duration":6,
    "start_date":"2026-11-11",
    "tentative_end_date":"2027-05-11"
    
    
}


### retrieve an assigned projects

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/a645e6f2-d391-4eda-a6df-7204a00d60ea/



### update an assigned project

PATCH   http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/a645e6f2-d391-4eda-a6df-7204a00d60ea/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "duration":8
    
    
}


### delete an assigned projects

DELETE  http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/a645e6f2-d391-4eda-a6df-7204a00d60ea/
